{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/a3815368f7f3c3c74167339c38e5fb59.poster.avif?t=1772036075\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/a3815368f7f3c3c74167339c38e5fb59.webm?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/a3815368f7f3c3c74167339c38e5fb59.mp4?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pip My Dice is a roguelike deck builder inspired by Balatro and the Yahtzee game. Customize different dice and use them together with powerful relics to break high scores and climb the leaderboard.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful relics to create synergies with your dice and upgrade your combination slots. Take your time and make wise decisions about what you buy in the shop and how you use it. Don't be greedy, you never know if you are going to roll what you are expecting... Unless you customize your dice so much that all faces are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/59610cc153955d0ca268d27631f44ec3.poster.avif?t=1772036075\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/59610cc153955d0ca268d27631f44ec3.webm?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/59610cc153955d0ca268d27631f44ec3.mp4?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endless replayability with the guarantee that every run will be different from the previous one, and save your favorite seeds to replay and share those you like the most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize all faces of your dice individually to make the most of your relics and create game-breaking combos! Rig the odds by modifying the value of the dice faces, and make sure that there is no room for chance. Hold on to precious consumables to get you out of trouble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/47a593a1aa5f2e60cfb02ee12c3fd002.poster.avif?t=1772036075\" width=600 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/47a593a1aa5f2e60cfb02ee12c3fd002.webm?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797650/extras/47a593a1aa5f2e60cfb02ee12c3fd002.mp4?t=1772036075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130 Relics to create various builds and synergies with your dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboard with seeded or random runs to compete with the world or your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 15+ different starting dice cups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Different dice modifiers with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Different bosses to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats and Run History</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Consumables to give you some extra help when you need it the most</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your combination slots as the run goes on</p></li>